{"warnings":{"main":{"*":"Unrecognized parameter: redirect."}},"parse":{"title":"Berserker","pageid":49668,"text":{"*":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Class_Titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Class Titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Creation_Guide\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Creation Guide</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Picking_the_Right_Race\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Picking the Right Race</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Starting_Statistics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Starting Statistics</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Suggested_Starting_Statistics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Suggested Starting Statistics</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Berserker_AAs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Berserker AAs</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Skills\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Skills</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Frenzy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Frenzy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Rage_and_Combat_Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rage and Combat Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Combat_Skills\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Combat Skills</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Combat_Disciplines\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Combat Disciplines</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Miscellaneous_Skills\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Miscellaneous Skills</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Stances_&amp;_Invocations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Stances &amp; Invocations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Berserker-Specific_Quests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Berserker-Specific Quests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Gearing\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gearing</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Pre-Planar\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pre-Planar</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Planar\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Planar</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#Kunark\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Kunark</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#Velious_Pre-Raid/Group\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Velious Pre-Raid/Group</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-21\"><a href=\"#Velious_Raiding\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Velious Raiding</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-22\"><a href=\"#FAQ\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">FAQ</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n<pre>A Berserker is a savage melee damage dealer who specializes in overwhelming enemies with brutal two-handed weapons and furious combat techniques.\n- EQLegends\n</pre>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"Description\">Description</h1><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Description\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=Special:Upload&amp;wpDestFile=C_berserker.gif\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:C berserker.gif\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\">File:C berserker.gif</span></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Berserkers are a pure melee class focused on dealing heavy damage through aggressive combat abilities, powerful strikes, and thrown weapons.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Class_Titles\">Class Titles</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Class Titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Class Titles\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>In the original <a href=\"/Kunark\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kunark\">Kunark</a> expansion, classes would gain new titles at levels over 50. In EverQuest Legends, these titles are not available, and it is unknown how they will be presented. While they may be available with future level cap increases, they are included here only for posterity:\n</p>\n<table class=\"eoTable2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Level 1-50\n</th>\n<th>Level 51-54\n</th>\n<th>Level 55-59\n</th>\n<th>Level 60\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<td>Berserker</td>\n<td>Bloodreaver</td>\n<td>Ravager</td>\n<td>Destroyer\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"Creation_Guide\">Creation Guide</h1><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Creation Guide\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Creation Guide\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Picking_the_Right_Race\">Picking the Right Race</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Picking the Right Race\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Picking the Right Race\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>When creating a character you must first select your primary race.  This race will be locked in at level 11, and can't be changed until you unlock other races.  Below are the race options for this class, as well as their stat line.\n</p><p>When selecting a race, a big consideration is the factions it is associate with and opposed to.  There may also be some racial benefits or penalties to consider as well.  Clicking on the name of the race will take you to the detailed race pages where these are defined in detail.\n</p>\n<table class=\"eoTable2 sortable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Race</th>\n<th>Str</th>\n<th>Sta</th>\n<th>Agi</th>\n<th>Dex</th>\n<th>Wis</th>\n<th>Int</th>\n<th>Cha\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left\"><b><a href=\"/Barbarian\" title=\"Barbarian\">Barbarian</a></b></td>\n<td>103</td>\n<td>95</td>\n<td>82</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>55\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left\"><b><a href=\"/Dwarf\" title=\"Dwarf\">Dwarf</a></b></td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>83</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>45\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left\"><b><a href=\"/Kerra\" title=\"Kerra\">Kerra</a></b></td>\n<td>TBD</td>\n<td>TBD</td>\n<td>TBD</td>\n<td>TBD</td>\n<td>TBD</td>\n<td>TBD</td>\n<td>TBD\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left\"><b><a href=\"/Ogre\" title=\"Ogre\">Ogre</a></b></td>\n<td>130</td>\n<td>127</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>67</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>37\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left\"><b><a href=\"/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">Troll</a></b></td>\n<td>108</td>\n<td>114</td>\n<td>83</td>\n<td>75</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>40\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left\"><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Berserker</a> Adds</b></td>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Starting_Statistics\">Starting Statistics</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Starting Statistics\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Starting Statistics\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>This section should be deleted\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Suggested_Starting_Statistics\">Suggested Starting Statistics</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Suggested Starting Statistics\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Suggested Starting Statistics\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Prioritize Strength and Stamina, with Dexterity also worth considering depending on gearing goals\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"Berserker_AAs\">Berserker AAs</h1><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Berserker AAs\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Berserker AAs\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>All AAs are available at <a href=\"/Alternate_Advancement\" title=\"Alternate Advancement\">Alternate Advancement</a>, the class AAs listed here are updated automatically from there.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Berserker Class AAs\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Ranks</th>\n<th>Cost</th>\n<th>Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blood Rune</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1/2/3</td>\n<td>Melee and ability critical hits give you 5/10/15% of the damage done as an absorption shield, up to 5/8/10% of your max hitpoints. Requirements: level 1.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Innate Power Strike</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>Grants the Berserker an increased chance to critically strike. Requirements: level 1.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tireless Spirit</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Ability Activation ID: 372 - Refresh Time: 0:25:00 - Ability Timer(s): 3. This ability, when activated, increases your movement speed by 125% for 18 seconds. Requirements: level 10.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Unbound Fury</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>This passive ability increases your chance to land a critical hit with your melee attacks and abilities by 2/4/6%. Requirements: level 12/30/50.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"Skills\">Skills</h1><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Skills\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Skills\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Berserker_Skills\" title=\"Berserker Skills\">Berserker Skill Table</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Frenzy\">Frenzy</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Frenzy\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Frenzy\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Frenzy is a signature Berserker attack that delivers rapid strikes and is central to the class’s damage output.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Rage_and_Combat_Techniques\">Rage and Combat Techniques</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Rage and Combat Techniques\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Rage and Combat Techniques\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Berserkers rely on aggressive offensive disciplines and abilities to maximize damage at close range.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Combat_Skills\">Combat Skills</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Combat Skills\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Combat Skills\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"eoTable2 sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"><b>Level</b>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\"><b>Skill</b>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\"><b>Trained</b>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\"><b>Pre 50 Cap</b>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\"><b>Post 50 Cap</b>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Frenzy\" title=\"Frenzy\">Frenzy</a>\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Throwing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Throwing\">Throwing</a>\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Disarm\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disarm\">Disarm</a>\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Dodge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dodge\">Dodge</a>\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Parry\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Parry\">Parry</a>\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Block\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Block\">Block</a>\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Double_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Double Attack\">Double Attack</a>\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Riposte\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Riposte\">Riposte</a>\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>46\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Skill_Triple_Attack\" title=\"Skill Triple Attack\">Triple Attack</a>\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td>\n<td>[Cap]\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Combat_Disciplines\">Combat Disciplines</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Combat Disciplines\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Combat Disciplines\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"eoTable2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Level\n</th>\n<th>Discipline\n</th>\n<th>Endurance Cost\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th>Duration\n</th>\n<th>Reuse Time\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>Tendon Slice\n</td>\n<td>75\n</td>\n<td>Take a swipe at your opponents legs, causing slower movement speed for a short time.\n</td>\n<td>1:00\n</td>\n<td>12 sec (timer 16)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td>Skull Bash\n</td>\n<td>125\n</td>\n<td>Aims a weapon blow at your opponents head, briefly stunning them.\n</td>\n<td>Instant\n</td>\n<td>12 sec (timer 16)\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Miscellaneous_Skills\">Miscellaneous Skills</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Miscellaneous Skills\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Miscellaneous Skills\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"eoTable2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Skill Name\n</th>\n<th>Level Obtained\n</th>\n<th>Trained\n</th>\n<th>Max\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Athletics\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Athletics\">Athletics</a>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Strategy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Strategy\">Strategy</a>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Skill_Alcohol_Tolerance\" title=\"Skill Alcohol Tolerance\">Alcohol Tolerance</a>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>255\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Skill_Begging\" title=\"Skill Begging\">Begging</a>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>255?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Skill_Bind_Wound\" title=\"Skill Bind Wound\">Bind Wound</a>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>210\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Skill_Sense_Heading\" title=\"Skill Sense Heading\">Sense Heading</a>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>200\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Skill_Swimming\" title=\"Skill Swimming\">Swimming</a>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td>\n<td>200\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"Stances_&amp;_Invocations\"><span id=\"Stances_.26_Invocations\"></span>Stances &amp; Invocations</h1><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Stances &amp; Invocations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Stances &amp; Invocations\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"eoTable2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Balanced Stance\n</td>\n<td>All incoming damage is reduced by 10% and your chance to hit is increased by 10%. Endurance regen excluding out of combat bonus regen is doubled. There is no endurance cost to upkeep this stance.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Offensive Stance\n</td>\n<td>Outgoing melee damage is increased by 100% and your chance to hit is increased by 25%. Every point of bonus damage dealt consumes an equal amount of endurance, with a reduction based on your <a href=\"/Strategy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Strategy\">strategy</a> skill.\n<p>When below 25% endurance, the chance to hit bonus is reduced based on the remaining percent of endurance. \n</p><p>Bonus damage from critical hits and similar effects do not cost endurance. \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Striker Stance\n</td>\n<td>Outgoing weapon skill abilities deal 3x damage and non-weapon skill abilities deal 5x damage, and your chance to hit is increased by 25%. Every point of damage dealt consumes an equal amount of endurance, with a reduction based on your <a href=\"/Strategy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Strategy\">strategy</a> skill.\n<p>When below 25% endurance, the chance to hit bonus is reduced based on the remaining percent of endurance. Bonus damage from critical hits and similar effects do not cost endurance. \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mage Hunter Stance\n</td>\n<td>All incoming spell damage is reduced by 50% and incoming physical damage is reduced by 20%. Every point of damage reduced consumes an equal amount of endurance, with a reduction based on your <a href=\"/Strategy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Strategy\">strategy</a> skill.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ranged Stance\n</td>\n<td>Your range attack has no minimum distance, gains a 25% accuracy bonus, and can double and triple attack. Every point of damage consumes endurance, with a reduction based on your <a href=\"/Strategy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Strategy\">strategy</a> skill.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Berserker Stance\n</td>\n<td>While this stance is active, attack speed and combat skill recharge rate is doubled and your chance to hit and combat skill damage is increased by 25%. Every point of damage dealt consumes half that amount in endurance, with a reduction based on your <a href=\"/Strategy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Strategy\">strategy</a> skill. You also take 8.3% of outgoing damage to yourself. Bonus damage from critical hits and similar effects do not cost endurance.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"Berserker-Specific_Quests\">Berserker-Specific Quests</h1><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: Berserker-Specific Quests\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Berserker-Specific Quests\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"Gearing\">Gearing</h1><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=16\" title=\"Edit section: Gearing\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Gearing\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Class specific gear suggestions are cross listed on the <a href=\"/Players:Gear\" title=\"Players:Gear\">Gear Reference</a> page. See also <a href=\"/index.php?title=Equipping_a_Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Equipping a Berserker (page does not exist)\">Equipping a Berserker</a>.\n</p><p>Check <a href=\"/Category:Berserker_Equipment\" title=\"Category:Berserker Equipment\">Berserker Equipment</a> for the full list of gear usable by Berserkers.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Pre-Planar\">Pre-Planar</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=17\" title=\"Edit section: Pre-Planar\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=17\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Pre-Planar\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Planar\">Planar</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=18\" title=\"Edit section: Planar\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=18\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Planar\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Kunark\">Kunark</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=19\" title=\"Edit section: Kunark\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=19\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Kunark\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Velious_Pre-Raid/Group\"><span id=\"Velious_Pre-Raid.2FGroup\"></span>Velious Pre-Raid/Group</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=20\" title=\"Edit section: Velious Pre-Raid/Group\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Berserker&amp;action=edit&amp;section=20\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Velious Pre-Raid/Group\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Velious_Raiding\">Velious Raiding</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">